  "notes": "Aladin Lite embed filling the viewport. The canvas is the whole UI: DSS/PanSTARRS-style colour sky imagery of Orion B (Alnitak, Flame/Horsehead area) overlaid with many catalogs in distinct marker shapes/colours (red circles SIMBAD, teal diamonds YSO candidates, orange squares Gaia, yellow filled dots notes), lime/green/purple instrument footprint rectangles (WIRCam, NIRCam, KMOS, MUSE) and a translucent orange MOC coverage blob. Controls are small light-grey boxes with 2px dark borders and 3px radius, monospace text; the coordinate field shows the center in magenta. A magenta crosshair marks the view centre. Hidden-but-live: layer 'Stack' panel (overlays and surveys with eye/gear/trash buttons), hover tooltips, and a bottom source table on marker click."
